{%- comment -%}
  vat-note

  Market-aware tax note shown next to prices. The United States market is not a
  VAT jurisdiction, so US sessions must never render an '(INC VAT)' claim.
  Wording is consistent with the US cart notice added in Wave B.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if localization.country.iso_code == 'US' -%}(EXCL. TAX){%- else -%}(INC VAT){%- endif -%}
